  "result": "`maskSecret` is added to `src/cli/mask.ts` and committed as `e40e146`. `npm run fast` passes (biome, boundaries, tsc and 18 related tests).\n\n- **Behavior:** it keeps the last four characters and replaces the rest with `*`. A value of four or fewer characters is fully starred, so a short secret is never shown. It counts by code point, so emoji aren't split.\n- **Tests:** `test/cli/mask.test.ts` covers longer values, short and empty values, and emoji.\n- **Shard weight:** the repo's `shard-weight-coverage` rule failed until the new test file had an entry. I added `'test/cli/mask.test.ts': 0.1` to `scripts/lib/shard-weights.mjs`, with 0.1 as an estimate, not a measured value.\n- **Notes:** the plan is in `docs/notes-mask-secret.md`, written before the code and updated as I went.\n\nI did not push or open a PR. Per KRN-07, integration needs a passing CI check on the pushed HEAD.",
